cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below. Please
  also cite the underlying connectome datasets it builds on (see references).
title: "FruitFlyBrain: Drosophila connectome datasets & projects"
abstract: >-
  An organized workspace bundling officially released Drosophila melanogaster
  brain connectome data (Janelia FlyEM hemibrain v1.2 and Princeton FlyWire
  FAFB annotations) with five runnable projects: connectome graph analysis, a
  whole-brain neurotransmitter atlas, a synaptic pathway tracer, a
  connectome-constrained neural-network simulation, and a 3D neuron viewer.
